{"id":"5cdab62986807336","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-smn.md","title":"Parameter Specialization Theorem","display":"thm-smn — Parameter Specialization Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-smn","aliases":["90-thm-smn"],"display":"thm-smn — Parameter Specialization Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-encoding]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-smn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-smn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smn — Parameter Specialization Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\Phi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的编号族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\">\\(\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,\\vec a)\">\\((e,\\vec a)\\)</span> 在输入位置表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle e\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec a\">\\(\\langle e\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec a\\)</span>。编号只含正元数分量，但允许零个被固定参数；输出元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 不为零。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{m,n}\">\\(s_{m,n}\\)</span> 的参数顺序为程序索引、随后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个固定参数。以下以函数图成员等价覆盖双方同时发散的情形。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\exists s_{m,n}\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{m+1}\\\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\ \\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl[(\\vec x,z)\\in\\Phi_n(s_{m,n}(e,\\vec a))\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\vec a{}^\\frown\\vec x,z)\\in\\Phi_{m+n}(e)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\exists s_{m,n}\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{m+1}\\\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\ \\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl[(\\vec x,z)\\in\\Phi_n(s_{m,n}(e,\\vec a))\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\vec a{}^\\frown\\vec x,z)\\in\\Phi_{m+n}(e)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\">\\(m,n\\)</span>。对数值参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>，先按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a> 判断是否 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a)\">\\(b=\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a)\\)</span>；不合法则永不返回，合法则在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 上运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}_{m+n}(\\Phi_{m+n})(e,\\vec a,\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}_{m+n}(\\Phi_{m+n})(e,\\vec a,\\vec x)\\)</span>。二进制数值与有限词可有效互换，元数固定的词解码是有限扫描，所以这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元有效编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi(b)\">\\(\\Psi(b)\\)</span>。可接受性的翻译条款给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_n(c(b))=\\Psi(b)\">\\(\\Phi_n(c(b))=\\Psi(b)\\)</span>。置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{m,n}(e,\\vec a)=c(\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a))\">\\(s_{m,n}(e,\\vec a)=c(\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a))\\)</span>；打包及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 均为总可计算过程，复合得到所需总递归函数。该论证不使用递归定理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时也可直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{0,n}(e)=e\">\\(s_{0,n}(e)=e\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 该定理补齐原递归定理链实际调用的 s-m-n 来源，不改动那些固定点定理的谓词、索引顺序或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"1802adc1900d4b34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"1802adc1900d4b34","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}$ 是 [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] 的编号族。$m\\in\\mathbb N$、$n\\ge1$；$e,z\\in\\mathbb N$、$\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m$、$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"固定 $m,n$。对数值参数 $b$，先按 [[90-df-encoding]] 判断是否 $b=\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a)$；不合法则永不返回，合法则在输入 $\\vec x$ 上运行 $\\operatorname{Eval}_{m+n}(\\Phi_{m+n})(e,\\vec a,\\vec x)$。二进制数值与有限词可有效互换，元数固定的词解码是有限扫描，所以这给出 $n$ 元有效编号 $\\Psi(b)$。可接受性的翻译条款给出 $c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1$，使 $\\Phi_n(c(b))=\\Psi(b)$。置 $s_{m,n}(e,\\vec a)=c(\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a))$；打包及 $c$ 均为总可计算过程，复合得到所需总递归函数。该论证不使用递归定理。$m=0$ 时也可直接取 $s_{0,n}(e)=e$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"e,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"(e,\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle e\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec a","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"s_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\exists s_{m,n}\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{m+1}\\\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\ \\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl[(\\vec x,z)\\in\\Phi_n(s_{m,n}(e,\\vec a))\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\vec a{}^\\frown\\vec x,z)\\in\\Phi_{m+n}(e)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"m,n","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"b=\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eval}_{m+n}(\\Phi_{m+n})(e,\\vec a,\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi(b)","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_n(c(b))=\\Psi(b)","display":false},{"tex":"s_{m,n}(e,\\vec a)=c(\\operatorname{pack}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a))","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"s_{0,n}(e)=e","display":false}],"bytes":2200,"backlinks":[{"id":"279ca56a651294c7","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"所有 $W_e$ 取 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的编号；有限集合的索引可由 [[90-thm-smn]] 在该编号中统一取得，见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"3e426ba53e1b66a0","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"二元投影 $(e,x)\\mapsto e$ 有一个程序索引；由 [[90-thm-smn]] 固化第一参数，得到上述全递归 $c$。对 $c$ 应用 [[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]，所得固定点程序在输入 $0$ 上输出 $e$。"},{"id":"40d9084cba778b26","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由 [[90-thm-smn]] 取 $s\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_2$ 使 $\\varphi_{s(a,b)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(b,x)$。给定全递归 $f$，下述二元部分函数是部分递归的：在 $(z,x)$ 上先算 $s(z,z)$、$f(s(z,z))$，然后模拟 $\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}(x)$。取它的二元程序索引 $a$，令 $e=s(a,a)$。则"},{"id":"0faa654605ca7e90","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由 [[90-thm-smn]] 取全递归 $q(z,\\vec n)$ 满足 $\\varphi_{q(z,\\vec n)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_z^{(k+2)}(z,\\vec n,x)$。令 $H(z,\\vec n,x)\\simeq F(q(z,\\vec n),\\vec n,x)$，它是 $(k+2)$ 元部分递归函数，取其索引 $a$。置 $r(\\vec n)=q(a,\\vec n)$ 即得结论。"},{"id":"8c2be80a12f6ee89","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 $F$ 的二元索引 $a$。由 [[90-thm-smn]]，$c(n)=s(a,n)$ 是全递归索引变换，且 $\\varphi_{c(n)}(x)\\simeq F(n,x)$。对 $c$ 应用 [[90-thm-recursion-theorem]] 即得所求 $e$。"},{"id":"b8b8df152b92c5d9","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由 [[90-thm-smn]] 取 $s\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_2$ 使 $\\varphi_{s(a,b)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(b,x)$。给定全递归 $f$，下述二元部分函数是部分递归的：在 $(z,x)$ 上先算 $s(z,z)$、$f(s(z,z))$，然后模拟 $\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}(x)$。取它的二元程序索引 $a$，令 $e=s(a,a)$。则"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-smn]]"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"| `wordenc`、`worddec` | 带元数前缀的数值元组词编码及像集上的部分逆；空元组的词码是单个位0。 | [[90-df-encoding]] |\n| `AcceptNum`、`EffNum`、`s_{m,n}` | 有效通用求值、覆盖及全递归翻译；s-m-n保留程序索引在先的顺序。 | [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]、[[90-thm-smn]] |\n| `Halts_M`、`Output_M`、`Comp_k^{88}` | 本地通用双向纸带的停机、词输出及数值可计算性；不等同于半无限纸带历史码。 | [[90-df-tm-halts]]、[[90-df-tm-output]]、[[90-df-computable-function]] |\n| 子语言呈示的 `EssUnd_{S,g}(P)` | 对P自身语言中的Ax视图作句子集嵌入，不改P三元组及当前S,g。 | [[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] |"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1802adc1900d4b34","8f303a307372354c","137d75d038de4a47"]}